  "interpretation": {
    "Wanping 42 | red facing brick": "6 px bed spacing. A full same-course stretcher/header pair measures 31–32 px, with 16 px sideways shift in the next row.",
    "Wanping 42 | ochre facing brick": "6–7 px courses and 31–32 px to the next long/short pair. Continuous ochre colour makes individual joints lower contrast.",
    "Wanping 42 | vertical red soldier brick": "Projected pilaster strip has 7 px between upright joints, approximately 20 px between same-column horizontal joints. Neighbouring columns are offset by about 10 px. The higher correlation is the half-brick offset in the adjacent column; same-column full lengths are less distinct."
  },
